      },
      "text": "```\nPLANT SECONDARY METABOLITE OVERVIEW\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nPRIMARY METABOLITES:              SECONDARY METABOLITES:\n  (required for all cells)          (specialized functions)\n  Carbohydrates                     ~200,000 known compounds\n  Proteins                          ~100,000 in plants alone (est.)\n  Lipids                            Not required for basic growth\n  Nucleic acids                     Ecologically essential"
