      "text": "SECONDARY METABOLITE CLASSES:\n  ALKALOIDS: nitrogen-containing; ~12,000 known\n  TERPENES: isoprene-based; ~40,000 known\n  PHENOLICS: aromatic ring from shikimate pathway; ~8,000 known\n  GLUCOSINOLATES: sulfur-containing; ~130 known\n  Other classes: cyanogenic glycosides, lectins, protease inhibitors, etc."
